+  effects: v3-chat and grid use `onAcceptedVertex` as a no-op and derive live
+  state from `onProjection`; the room's migration-local collectors are
+  bounded reconstruction observers whose results are checked against
+  canonical projection/state. GREEN must source-audit every current consumer
+  and pin this inventory. Any consumer that proves an un-idempotent durable
+  side effect is a blocking contradiction and forces the transactional-port
+  reslice below.
